        <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/glosis/model/codelists/results/OrganicMatterClassValueCollection"/>
        <skos:definition>Refers to the categorization or classification of soil based on the quality, quantity, and composition of organic matter present, influencing soil properties such as fertility, water retention, and microbial activity. Source: Source: FAO, Soil Organic Matter and Soil Health, Land and Water Development Division.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


