        <terms:isPartOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/glosis/model/codelists/results/ContrastValueCollection"/>
        <skos:definition>The mottles are evident only on close examination. Soil colours in both the matrix and mottles have closely related hues, chromas and values.</skos:definition>
